# A query, answered in batches, then done with the coverage that held.
# A name that is not UTF-8 travels as its bytes.
> {"id":4,"query":{"root":"/home/user","name":{"match":"skwir","text":"report","case_sensitive":false},"kinds":["file"],"limit":100}}
